 /> To expand, the Backbenders we know are surgeons and the gigantes are slavers who IIRC employ soul stones.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait. Where in the corebook is this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-28T20:45:06-07:00","id":1239885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237380-what-man-was-not-meant-to-know?p=1239871#post1239871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait. Where in the corebook is this</div> </div> </div> </div>Page 93, left column, third paragraph under the heading &quot;The Southeast&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","name":"Verzio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar572_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-28T22:05:10-07:00","id":1239900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Verzio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237380-what-man-was-not-meant-to-know?p=1239885#post1239885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Page 93, left column, third paragraph under the heading &quot;The Southeast&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Darn it. Once again, there is something interesting in the corebook that I did not find.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T10:44:53-07:00","id":1240128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237380-what-man-was-not-meant-to-know?p=1239729#post1239729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is absolutely not a sidereal charm. It is something that is wholly outside the loom. It would make much more sense for a general Infernal charm or sorcery but it's not something that could be woven into the loom. Due to how antithical it is to it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Clearly, your mileage varies. From my perspective, deducing the properties of a previous reality and bringing those principles into Creation lines up perfectly with the Theanoan school. Further, forcing someone to work under a cherry picked assortment of the most unfriendly rules extant in a series of related games and editions is pretty damn emblemic for the splat that can say \u201cno, Game Master, that never happened,\u201d \u201cI\u2019ll just take all the benefits of that rail of Celestial Cocaine and duck the bad stuff, mm-kay?,\u201d and \u201chmm, I\u2019ll choose the reality shard where I utterly defeat my enemy at the cost of my beloved\u2019s very soul, thankyouverymuch!\u201d And if it\u2019s just fluff that\u2019s bothering you, note that the Charm is basically a Sorcery spell that Jupiter recoded as a Charm\u2014it doesn\u2019t need to be Loom-based any more than the Celestisl Circle Sorcery Charm itself is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T11:07:22-07:00","id":1240144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>39Steps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237380-what-man-was-not-meant-to-know?p=1240128#post1240128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Clearly, your mileage varies. From my perspective, deducing the properties of a previous reality and bringing those principles into Creation lines up perfectly with the Theanoan school. Further, forcing someone to work under a cherry picked assortment of the most unfriendly rules extant in a series of related games and editions is pretty damn emblemic for the splat that can say \u201cno, Game Master, that never happened,\u201d \u201cI\u2019ll just take all the benefits of that rail of Celestial Cocaine and duck the bad stuff, mm-kay?,\u201d and \u201chmm, I\u2019ll choose the reality shard where I utterly defeat my enemy at the cost of my beloved\u2019s very soul, thankyouverymuch!\u201d And if it\u2019s just fluff that\u2019s bothering you, note that the Charm is basically a Sorcery spell that Jupiter recoded as a Charm\u2014it doesn\u2019t need to be Loom-based any more than the Celestisl Circle Sorcery Charm itself is.</div> </div> </div> </div>It absolutely does though. Celestial circle sorcery requires a prayer charm for sidereals to access. It's not something outside of fate. And black mirror style, well apart from needing a huge fix, is also an expression of what's in creation rather than what's outside. It's not just the fluff though, that charm also needs work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T11:39:20-07:00","id":1240154,"title":"","content":"Also, I personally want to know what exactly the deal with the broken winged crane is. What exactly causes it to make people yozi sympathizers is it just really good mind control?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"k